  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -2,
  "section_notes": "The final text keeps S2's 5% cap and model-level results away from the general public (Northwind's NW-1 and Halcyon's HC-1 both met), but leaves existing models on sale under an open-ended regulator-set schedule, so S2 is the weakest section. S5 now makes exceeding 8 per 100,000 a mandatory regulator-required recall with no transition, which materially harms Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9). S1 is strong (24h for serious, 5 business days for others, customer notice in 5 business days). The S3 new-unit deadline is an absolute date (1 January 2029) with no stated adoption date, so months-from-adoption is recorded as null."
 },
